al. Great for batch operations or scripting.","Every task Jev performs is recorded in a trace file. Review exactly what actions were taken, in what order, and how long each one took."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Capitalofgeorgiapolitician1569/mobile-jev/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"6561d545d891ab45c5d05278b76a72135ffc72b157f4d4138743a64079c4738b","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T22:06:38.154Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:12.907Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Once you land on the page, look for the green \"Code\" button. Click it, then select \"Download ZIP\". This will save a compressed folder to your computer.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Capitalofgeorgiapolitician1569/mobile-jev/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"All you need is this app and an account with Mobilerun (details below).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Capitalofgeorgiapolitician1569/mobile-jev/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You only need this computer, internet, and a Mobilerun account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Capitalofgeorgiapolitician1569/mobile-jev/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"✅ Created a Mobilerun account and got an API key","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Capitalofgeorgiapolitician1569/mobile-jev/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"6561d545d891ab45c5d05278b76a72135ffc72b157f4d4138743a64079c4738b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Capitalofgeorgiapolitician1569/mobile-jev/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:12.907Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-10T05:55:04Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Capitalofgeorgiapolitician1569/mobile-jev/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T07:04:12.908Z","hash":"6561d545d891ab45c5d05278b76a72135ffc72b157f4d4138743a64079c4738b","originalBytes":8656,"storedBytes":8656,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"202